<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CHOICE IN TALKS, ADVISES CAUTION IN DEALINGS.</title>
<headline>CHOICE IN TALKS, ADVISES CAUTION IN DEALINGS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Choice Holdings Ltd on Tuesday advised shareholders it was in negotiations which, if successful, could affect the price at which the company's shares trade on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders to exercise caution when dealing in the company's shares pending a further announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
